        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">professional experiences</h2>

		<section>
			<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between gap-2">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Ahold Delhaize | TechNL Labs | DevOps engineer intern</h3>
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">[feb 2026] [jul 2026]</h3>
			</div>
			<p>
				Responsible for creating AI-driven web applications and prototypes using state-of-the-art generative AI technologies, while implementing new features, solving technical challenges, and delivering high-impact solutions that improved productivity, efficiency, and visual content production for internal teams.
			</p>
			<small>python • kotlin • react • typescript • ci/cd • argocd • kubernetes • argocd • azure • llm integration</small>
		</section>

        <hr />

		<section>
			<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between gap-2">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Schiphol Catering Service | production staff</h3>
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">[jun 2025] [feb 2026]</h3>
			</div>
			<p>
				Managed complete flight catering operations at Schiphol Airport, including loading and unloading
